            <title>[IGNITE-6768] .NET: Thin client: Cache id is calculated incorrectly</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6768</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;tt&gt;BinaryUtiles.GetStringHashCode&lt;/tt&gt; to get cache id, but this method uses uppercase characters only.&lt;/p&gt;

